  "source_code": "t = int(input())\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = sorted(map(int, input().split()), reverse=True)\r\n    \r\n    pre = [0]\r\n    for x in a:\r\n        pre.append(pre[-1] + x)\r\n        \r\n    ans = 0\r\n    \r\n    for A in range(n + 1):\r\n        lo, hi = 0, n - A\r\n        \r\n        while lo < hi:\r\n            B = (lo + hi) // 2\r\n            \r\n            u = A + 2 * B\r\n            v = 3 * n - 2 * A - B\r\n            \r\n            if a[u] + a[u + 1] >= 3 * a[v - 1]:\r\n                lo = B + 1\r\n            else:\r\n                hi = B\r\n            \r\n        B = lo\r\n        u = A + 2 * B\r\n        v = 3 * n - 2 * A - B\r\n            \r\n        ans = max(ans, 2 * pre[A] + pre[u] + 3 * pre[v])\r\n    print(ans)",
